WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.880
Waiting for more John Wick? Missing the Marvel&nbsp;
Universe? Or maybe you're after something new?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:13.347
Either way, Hollywood has got you covered — and it&nbsp;
looks like 2024 is going to be a heck of a year for film. 

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:19.980
Sony's Spider-Man universe is ready to re-open&nbsp;
in 2024 with the release of the weirder, wilder,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:25.740
and woman-centric spin-off, Madame Web. Based&nbsp;
on a somewhat obscure Marvel Comics character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.760
the film will introduce audiences&nbsp;
to mystical oracle Cassandra Webb,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:34.440
an elderly ally of the webbed wall-crawler&nbsp;
who uses her powers of clairvoyance to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.940
into his future. With her unique and&nbsp;
surprising psychic powers, Webb isn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:43.620
the kind of action-oriented hero you might expect&nbsp;
to see carry their own big-budget feature film.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.120
To that end, it seems that Sony has made some&nbsp;
significant changes to the character for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.860
upcoming movie, including casting a young&nbsp;
actor, Dakota Johnson, in the title role.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.320
Madame Web will be joined by quite a talented&nbsp;
cast, featuring stars such as Sydney Sweeney,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.600
Celeste O'Connor, and Adam Scott. Sweeney was&nbsp;
recently confirmed to be playing Julia Carpenter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:08.460
an early iteration of Spider-Woman, in&nbsp;
the character's live-action debut. Indeed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.540
the film is expected to see a team-up of&nbsp;
various Spider-Women drawn from the comics.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:16.500
Though little is known about the plot at&nbsp;
this stage, Sony will no doubt be hoping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:23.580
for another success like Tom Hardy's Venom when&nbsp;
Madame Web lands in theaters on February 16th,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:32.940
2024. The worst case scenario, we'd&nbsp;
imagine, looks a little something like this.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:34.920
"Intriguing."

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:40.560
It's no easy task to go even bigger than the&nbsp;
blockbuster crossover Godzilla vs. Kong, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:46.620
the sequel, Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire, is&nbsp;
going to give it a shot. The previous film faced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:52.260
a mighty challenge back in 2021, as it released&nbsp;
to theaters and on HBO Max simultaneously due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:59.580
the ongoing COVID-19 pandemic; nevertheless, it&nbsp;
managed to net an impressive $470 million. With&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.720
theaters once again a big attraction these&nbsp;
days, the sequel stands to fare much better.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:09.840
Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire will see the&nbsp;
return of Rebecca Hall as Dr. Ilene Andrews&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:14.940
and Brian Tyree Henry as Bernie Hayes, while&nbsp;
Legion star Dan Stevens joins the franchise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:19.800
in an as-yet undisclosed role. But while the&nbsp;
first film depicted the epic battle between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:25.380
two titanic terrors, The New Empire will flip the&nbsp;
script. Picking up where the last film left off,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:30.420
Kong and Godzilla are now reluctant allies —&nbsp;
and the sequel will see the two beasts team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:35.880
up to take on a new menace. The New Empire&nbsp;
is set to be released on March 15th, 2024.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:42.120
Disney's live-action remakes have been hit or&nbsp;
miss to say the least, but that hasn't slowed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:47.820
the studio down one bit. In 2024, they're going to&nbsp;
tackle a classic, releasing a live-action version&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:52.980
of Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs, one of the&nbsp;
most beloved animated films of all time. If Disney&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:57.900
is going to do it justice, they'll need a roster&nbsp;
of the industry's best talent to bring it to life;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:03.120
Academy Award nominee Greta Gerwig has been hired&nbsp;
to pen the script, while The Amazing Spider-Man's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:07.860
Marc Webb is set to direct. Rachel Zegler of&nbsp;
West Side Story fame takes on the title role,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:12.660
while Gal Gadot trades in her heroic&nbsp;
tiara for a crown to play the Evil Queen.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:17.160
Disney has truncated the movie's title to&nbsp;
the simpler Snow White, and they're also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:21.780
planning to update the classic story for modern&nbsp;
audiences. The essence remains the same, however:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:26.700
Like the original, Snow White will follow a&nbsp;
young princess who is pursued by a vile queen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:32.040
and aided by seven hospitable dwarves. Will&nbsp;
Snow White be able to recapture the magic and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:36.600
meet with acclaim like Jon Favreau's The&nbsp;
Jungle Book? Or will it land with a thud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:42.420
like… pretty much all of the others? We'll find&nbsp;
out when the film arrives on March 22nd, 2024.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:48.720
After Ryan Reynolds all but forced Fox to push&nbsp;
the start button on the Deadpool franchise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:54.360
the Merc with the Mouth churned out two massive&nbsp;
money-making hits. But questions immediately arose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:59.220
when the studio was gobbled up by Disney: Would&nbsp;
Marvel want the foul-mouthed, R-rated Deadpool&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:05.400
films integrated into their family-friendly MCU?&nbsp;
Those concerns were put to bed in early 2021 by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:10.920
Marvel's head honcho Kevin Feige, who declared&nbsp;
that there would indeed be a third Deadpool movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:15.660
and that it would retain its harsh rating,&nbsp;
glorious violence, and dark sense of humor.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:20.220
But fans were in for one more surprise. When the&nbsp;
film was officially announced the following year,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:24.060
Reynolds revealed that Hugh Jackman&nbsp;
would be joining him for the threequel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:29.220
reprising his role as Wolverine — a return&nbsp;
he'd previously sworn off. We don't know much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.540
about the plot of Deadpool 3, although it's&nbsp;
likely the film will depict an epic clash&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:38.580
(and eventual team-up) between Wade Wilson&nbsp;
and Logan. Adam Project's Shawn Levy will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:43.020
be directing, and a number of cast members&nbsp;
from Deadpool and Deadpool 2 will return too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:48.540
including Morena Baccarin, Stefan Kapicic,&nbsp;
Brianna Hildebrand, and even Rob Delaney.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:52.320
"Never underestimate a man with a&nbsp;
mustache. Just ask anyone in Brooklyn.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.380
You're a goddamn superhero, you!"

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:55.880
"X-Force!"

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:01.320
The cast also includes Emma Corrin&nbsp;
and Matthew Macfadyen in unannounced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:05.220
roles. Deadpool 3 hits theaters on May 3rd, 2024.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:14.160
John Wick is one of the modern day's&nbsp;
hottest movie series, and in 2024,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:19.260
the franchise brings us the second of two&nbsp;
upcoming spin-off projects: Ballerina. Set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.540
between the third and fourth John Wick films,&nbsp;
Ballerina stars Ana de Armas as a deadly assassin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:29.640
with Keanu Reeves due to return in an extended&nbsp;
cameo role. Other actors scheduled to return,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:35.160
in some capacity or another, include Anjelica&nbsp;
Huston as the Director, Ian McShane as Winston,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:39.360
and Lance Reddick as Charon, in of&nbsp;
the late star's final performances.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:45.840
Len Wiseman, who helmed the 2012 remake of Total&nbsp;
Recall, is taking directorial duties on Ballerina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:50.340
while Emerald Fennell, writer-director of&nbsp;
Promising Young Woman, joined Shay Hatten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:53.940
to work on the script. Though not much has&nbsp;
been released regarding the film's story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:58.560
Ballerina stands to be another first-rate&nbsp;
action thriller, and, if the John Wick films&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:05.640
are anything to go by, it'll no doubt blow&nbsp;
fans away when it releases on June 7th, 2024.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:12.480
Pixar is known for founding wildly popular&nbsp;
franchises such as Toy Story and Cars, and,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:18.000
in 2024, they'll add another to its ranks with&nbsp;
Inside Out 2. The first film in the series came&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.680
out all the way back in 2015, and while the&nbsp;
kids who saw it in theaters may have grown up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:27.240
the sequel stands to bring in a whole new&nbsp;
generation of viewers. Written and directed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:32.160
by Pixar veteran Pete Docter, the first Inside&nbsp;
Out centers around a young girl named Riley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:36.720
whose emotions manifest as characters inside&nbsp;
her head. The movie was a monster hit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.720
amassing more than $800 million&nbsp;
dollars at the box office.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.280
Thus far, Amy Poehler is one of the few cast&nbsp;
members officially announced for the sequel;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:48.480
she'll reprise the role of Joy. Actor&nbsp;
Mindy Kaling, who voiced Disgust,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:52.800
has revealed that she is not involved, with&nbsp;
rumors swirling about contract negotiations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:57.720
breaking down over a salary dispute. Bill Hader,&nbsp;
who played Fear, will not be coming back, either,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:02.880
but Lewis Black and Phyllis Smith, who play Anger&nbsp;
and Sadness respectively, are expected to return.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:06.600
As for the plot? Well, Poehler has&nbsp;
revealed that the film will pick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:10.080
up with Riley as she deals with the&nbsp;
emotional changes of adolescence.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.540
"Hey, guys — what's puberty?"

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.180
"I dunno. Probably not important."

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.380
But we'll have to wait for June 14th,&nbsp;
2024 to see how it all goes down.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:25.200
Disney's live-action Lion King movie&nbsp;
proved divisive among fans and critics,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:30.120
with many feeling the shot-for-shot remake was a&nbsp;
wholly unnecessary endeavor. But the box office&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:35.100
doesn't lie: The Lion King made over $1 billion&nbsp;
dollars in theaters, making it quite clear there's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:41.220
a huge appetite for more adventures at Pride Rock.&nbsp;
Thus, in 2024, Disney will release a prequel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:45.780
Mufasa: The Lion King. If Beale Street Could&nbsp;
Talk director Barry Jenkins replaces Jon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:50.580
Favreau behind the camera, while Aaron Pierre&nbsp;
will step in as the voice of a younger Mufasa.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:56.340
Returning cast members for the prequel include&nbsp;
Billy Eichner and Seth Rogen as Timon and Pumbaa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.340 --> 00:08:01.860
as well as John Kani as Rafiki. Kelvin Harrison&nbsp;
Jr. will voice the younger Scar. Once again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:06.900
Disney will use life-like CGI animation&nbsp;
to recreate the stunning photorealistic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.860
world of The Lion King, this time&nbsp;
for a story that explores Mufasa's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:15.480
youth. Disney has so far revealed that&nbsp;
a devastating flood leaves him orphaned,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:20.700
to be adopted by another pride. Battling against&nbsp;
the odds, this ordinary outsider will rise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:26.220
up to take his place as the king of the&nbsp;
jungle — and it'll happen on July 5th, 2024.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:32.700
The second animated sequel to drop in the&nbsp;
summer of 2024, Despicable Me 4 comes seven&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.380
years after the third installment, but just two&nbsp;
years after the second Minions spin-off film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:41.160
which told the origin of the film's&nbsp;
anti-hero Gru. In this installment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.920
Gru is back, once again voiced by Steve Carell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:48.780
while Kristen Wiig returns as Lucy, Gru's&nbsp;
wife and an agent of the Anti-Villain League.

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:53.760
The little yellow Minions you — or, at least,&nbsp;
your kids — love will be back too, played by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:58.860
voice actor Pierre Coffin. What will they be up&nbsp;
to? Well, the details are sketchy at this point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:03.660
but what we do know is that the fourth film will&nbsp;
begin shortly after the events of Despicable Me 3,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:08.100
and will follow Gru, his family, and his&nbsp;
Minions, as they hunt bad guys for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:13.260
Anti-Villain League. So far, Illumination has&nbsp;
kept quiet regarding the plot's exact details,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:18.360
which we probably won't learn more about before&nbsp;
the first trailer releases. But there may be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:22.140
wait for the first footage, as the film's&nbsp;
ultimate release is still fairly far away;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:25.920
Despicable Me 4 is scheduled for July 3rd, 2024.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:27.600
[cheering]

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:33.360
Based on the novel by A.M. Shine, The Watchers&nbsp;
is a supernatural thriller whose director,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:37.740
Ishana Shyamalan, has been making a few&nbsp;
waves recently. The daughter of legendary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:42.000
director M. Night Shyamalan, Ishana cut&nbsp;
her teeth as second unit director on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.440
father's movie Old. She also worked as a&nbsp;
producer, writer, and director on the Apple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:51.900
TV+ series Servant. The Watchers will be her&nbsp;
big screen debut when it premieres in 2024.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:55.860
The novel tells the story of Mina,&nbsp;
a woman who becomes lost in an Irish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.280
forest and struggles to survive&nbsp;
while being hunted by strange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:04.500
otherworldly monsters. In this film version of the&nbsp;
story, actress Dakota Fanning will star as Mina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.860
while Georgina Campbell has been&nbsp;
cast in a leading role alongside her.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:11.340
Adapted to film by Ishana&nbsp;
Shyamalan and A.M. Shine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:16.080
the script became the subject of a minor&nbsp;
bidding war among rival studios — in the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:20.160
New Line Cinema won out. Though not yet&nbsp;
in production, The Watchers is due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:25.560
begin filming later this year, with a&nbsp;
planned release date of June 7th, 2024.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.340
M. Night Shyamalan films are fairly divisive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:33.600
but the director's willingness to take big&nbsp;
swings on unique projects always makes them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:38.580
must-watch experiences. That's especially true&nbsp;
now that he's focused himself on making smaller,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:43.860
stranger titles, such as The Visit and Old.&nbsp;
Whether you loved these movies or hated them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.120
they certainly got people talking. That's&nbsp;
what makes Shyamalan special — he's always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:52.560
bringing something fresh to a cinematic&nbsp;
landscape dominated by familiar brand names.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:57.960
And he's not done yet. In 2023, Shyamalan&nbsp;
faced the apocalypse with Knock at the Cabin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:03.840
and in 2024, he'll be leading us straight into&nbsp;
Trap, which is set for release on August 2nd,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:09.120
2024. Other than that, we don't know much about&nbsp;
it. Will it be an original Shyamalan script?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:13.740
Will it be adapted from a previous work? Will it&nbsp;
feature any big names that the director worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:18.480
with before? We're not sure. The only other bit&nbsp;
of info we know at the moment is that Trap will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:22.980
be the first film in a multi-year first-look&nbsp;
deal Shyamalan signed with Warner Bros.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:27.600
meaning the director is finally leaving&nbsp;
Universal, his long-time studio home.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:32.400
If you're looking for a studio with a&nbsp;
consistent track record of first-rate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.840
horror movies and thrillers, it's harder&nbsp;
to find better than Blumhouse. Since 2010,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.560
they've been responsible for some of the&nbsp;
most popular and critically-acclaimed horror&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:45.300
films around. They've also been a showcase for&nbsp;
up-and-coming directors, courtesy of hits such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:50.100
as James Wan's Insidious, Jordan Peele's Get&nbsp;
Out, and Leigh Whannell's The Invisible Man.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:54.780
"You think you're learning how to beat me,&nbsp;
so I'm gonna truly teach you something."

00:11:54.780 --> 00:12:00.300
So, naturally, the studio's upcoming suspense&nbsp;
story, Speak No Evil, is also bound to be a hit.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:05.820
A remake of a 2022 Danish film of the same&nbsp;
name, Speak No Evil is helmed by Woman in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:11.100
Black director James Watkins and will star James&nbsp;
McAvoy, whose performance in Blumhouse's Split and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:16.260
Glass earned him critical acclaim. The Danish&nbsp;
original follows Bjorn and Louise, a couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:21.420
who are invited to spend a holiday with Patrick,&nbsp;
Karin, and their son Abel, after meeting them on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:26.460
vacation in Tuscany. Planned as a pleasant weekend&nbsp;
in a remote village in the Netherlands, Bjorn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:31.860
and Louise's getaway spirals out of control when&nbsp;
their hosts begin exhibiting disturbing behavior.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:36.960
McAvoy will feature in the film alongside Scoot&nbsp;
McNairy and Mackenzie Davis, of Terminator:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:42.000
Dark Fate fame. The film is currently&nbsp;
scheduled to hit theaters on August 9th, 2024.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:48.900
There are few films more iconic to the goth&nbsp;
crowd than Beetlejuice, the 1988 absurdist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:53.820
black comedy from director Tim Burton. The&nbsp;
film starred Winona Ryder as Lydia Deetz,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:58.980
a morose teen who moves into a new home and meets&nbsp;
the ghosts of married couple Barbara and Adam,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:04.500
as well as a sass-talking trickster from the&nbsp;
underworld named Beetlejuice. Strange, surreal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:09.120
and entirely one-of-a-kind, the film made Tim&nbsp;
Burton one of Hollywood's hottest directors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:14.220
and helped solidify both Ryder and Michael&nbsp;
Keaton as stars. And while all attempts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:19.200
get a sequel off the ground have failed thus far,&nbsp;
it looks like we're finally getting one in 2024.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:25.800
Announced in May 2023, Beetlejuice 2 is finally a&nbsp;
go, and it already has its leading lady attached:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:30.900
Jenna Ortega, who more than proved her goth&nbsp;
credentials in Netflix's Wednesday. It looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:35.280
like Winona Ryder is coming back as Lydia&nbsp;
Deetz too, presumably the mother of Ortega's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:40.380
new character. She'll be joined by Catherine&nbsp;
O'Hara as Delia Deetz and Monica Bellucci as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.640
Beetlejuice's wife. Justin Theroux will&nbsp;
play an unknown part, and screen legend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:50.100
Willem Dafoe appears to be playing some sort of&nbsp;
afterlife law enforcement officer. And of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.280
you can't make a Beetlejuice movie&nbsp;
without Michael Keaton — luckily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:57.120
the Oscar-nominated star is indeed&nbsp;
returning as the ghost with the most.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.620
"It's showtime."

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:03.360
Wednesday scribes Miles Millar and Alfred&nbsp;
Gough are writing the script, while Burton&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:09.720
himself is expected to direct. Beetlejuice 2&nbsp;
will arrive in theaters on September 6th, 2024.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:16.080
Despite suffering a steady decline in box office&nbsp;
takings, Paramount continues to forge ahead with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:20.760
the Transformers movie franchise. Hot on the&nbsp;
heels of Transformers: Rise of the Beasts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:24.900
the studio is set to return the series&nbsp;
to its animated roots. Transformers One,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:30.060
a fully animated feature film, explores the&nbsp;
origins of the Autobots and Decepticons on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.780
Cybertron long before the events&nbsp;
of the 2007 blockbuster series.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:38.160
Revolving around the unlikely friendship&nbsp;
between Optimus Prime and Megatron,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:42.420
this movie will chronicle their journey to&nbsp;
becoming bitter rivals and deadly enemies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:47.460
The voice cast is impressive, with a group of&nbsp;
A-list superstars lending their talents to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:51.060
cartoon prequel, including Chris&nbsp;
Hemsworth and Bryan Tyree Henry.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:56.280
Toy Story 4 filmmaker Josh Cooley directs the&nbsp;
movie, while Steven Spielberg once again serves as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:02.700
producer. Transformers fans can expect to see the&nbsp;
movie roll out in cinemas on September 13th, 2024.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:09.120
Many fans believe that the third installment in&nbsp;
a superhero trilogy tends to be the worst. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:13.320
certainly rings true for the X-Men trilogy,&nbsp;
Sam Raimi's Spider-Man movies, and Blade:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.980
Trinity — although recent threequels such as&nbsp;
Captain America: Civil War and Spider-Man:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:22.560
No Way Home appear to have broken the curse. In&nbsp;
2024, Sony is hoping to continue that positive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:27.780
trend with a third Venom film, currently&nbsp;
scheduled for July 2024, in a rare move&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:33.060
of the studios announcing a sooner release date&nbsp;
than the original announcement for October 2024 .

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:37.500
Tom Hardy will be back in the title role,&nbsp;
of course, while Doctor Strange's Chiwetel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:42.900
Ejiofor has been cast in an undisclosed part,&nbsp;
and Emmy-nominated Ted Lasso star Juno Temple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:47.220
has joined the cast as well. And while Andy&nbsp;
Serkis impressed behind the director's chair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:52.020
in the second film, screenwriter Kelly Marcel&nbsp;
will take the helm for this one. Marcel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:56.340
who wrote the first two movies, is also penning&nbsp;
the script, based on a story she developed with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:56.340 --> 00:16:00.720
Hardy. Little is known about the plot of the&nbsp;
third movie, but after the conclusion of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:06.240
previous film, there are plenty of dangling plot&nbsp;
threads to follow. That said, given Tom Holland's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:10.620
recent announcement that he's about to take a&nbsp;
break from acting, it's unlikely we'll see his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:15.900
Peter Parker taking on Eddie Brock just yet&nbsp;
— despite the tease in Let There Be Carnage.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:20.520
Still, considering the billion-dollar gross&nbsp;
of the first two films and overwhelmingly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:25.200
positive reviews from fans, expectations&nbsp;
are high for the next movie to deliver even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.960
more spine-tingling thrills, over-the-top spills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:33.060
and gut-busting kills. Only time will tell&nbsp;
whether the threequel curse is truly broken.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:39.600
It's rare to see a sequel to a best picture&nbsp;
Oscar-winner, let alone a legacy sequel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:43.860
decades later, but that's exactly what&nbsp;
we're getting in 2024 when Ridley Scott&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:49.620
returns to direct Gladiator 2. The original,&nbsp;
released in 2000, won five Academy Awards,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:54.720
quickly cementing its reputation as a bona&nbsp;
fide classic. This is another chance for Scott&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:58.320
to return to one of his classic franchises as&nbsp;
director but Gladiator 2 will see a mostly-new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:01.920
cast of characters populate a story that&nbsp;
takes place in a very different world.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:05.640
"Are you not entertained?!"

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:10.800
Paul Mescal, who earned an Oscar nomination for&nbsp;
his work in Aftersun, stars as the lead character:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:15.600
a grown-up Lucius, the young boy portrayed&nbsp;
by Spencer Treat Clark in the original film.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:20.700
Connie Nielsen will be returning as Lucius'&nbsp;
mother, Lucilla, daughter of the late Emperor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:25.740
Marcus Aurelius. They will be joined by an&nbsp;
all-star cast that includes May Calamawy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:30.540
Denzel Washington, Pedro Pascal, Barry&nbsp;
Keoghan, and Derek Jacobi. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:36.300
David Scarpa has penned the script. Gladiator&nbsp;
2 is scheduled for November 22nd, 2024.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:42.960
After years of stops, starts, and missed release&nbsp;
dates, a feature film adaptation of Wicked is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:48.660
finally on the way. This vision of L. Frank Baum's&nbsp;
Oz reimagines Elphaba, the Wicked Witch of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:54.000
West, as a sympathetic protagonist. Her story is&nbsp;
told through an array of vibrant musical numbers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:59.100
that have become enormously popular with theater&nbsp;
kids and audiences alike. Given that ubiquity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:03.900
it's no surprise that the general public is so&nbsp;
hotly anticipating a movie version of Wicked.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:08.700
This adaptation is directed by Jon M. Chu,&nbsp;
who proved his musical chops helming In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:13.740
the Heights movie, while Cynthia Erivo of&nbsp;
Harriet and pop star Ariana Grande headline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:18.720
a star-studded ensemble cast as Elphaba and&nbsp;
Glinda, respectively. They'll be joined here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:23.460
by the Oscar-winning Michelle Yeoh as Madame&nbsp;
Morrible and Jeff Goldblum as the Wizard of Oz.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:27.720
With a lead cast like that, there's no&nbsp;
question that the beloved musical numbers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:32.340
in Wicked will be delivered with plenty&nbsp;
of gusto and energy. Fans can get excited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:36.240
about the potential for memorable imagery&nbsp;
in Chu's vibrant visual sensibilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:41.460
too. It's taken countless years of nervous&nbsp;
anticipation, but the first installment in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:46.980
two-part Wicked movie series is finally going&nbsp;
to arrive in theaters on November 27th, 2024.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:58.080
Video game adaptations used to be known&nbsp;
as a dud genre. Thanks in no small part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:02.100
to Sonic the Hedgehog, however, they're&nbsp;
now hotter than ever. One of the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.700
blockbusters to release before the&nbsp;
COVID-19 pandemic struck in 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:12.000
the first Sonic film took in $319 million at&nbsp;
the global box office. Its sequel performed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:16.860
even better. Sonic the Hedgehog 2 introduced&nbsp;
the villain Knuckles, voiced by Idris Elba,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:22.260
who is due for his own spin-off TV series on&nbsp;
Paramount+. And the movie franchise isn't slowing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:27.660
down anytime soon, as a proper threequel,&nbsp;
Sonic the Hedgehog 3, will drop in 2024.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:32.520
Not much is known about this next entry in&nbsp;
the series right now. However, a tease on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:37.440
Twitter announcing the film back in August 2022&nbsp;
suggests that both Tails and Knuckles could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.820
be back in action alongside the eponymous&nbsp;
Sonic, once again voiced by Ben Schwartz.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:46.320
Nobody's too sure whether Jim Carrey&nbsp;
will return as Dr. Robotnik, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:49.680
as the actor has said that he is&nbsp;
serious about retiring from acting.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:52.680
If he stands by his word,&nbsp;
we'll be in for a new villain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.860
because producers have said they&nbsp;
have no plans to replace Carrey in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:55.860 --> 00:20:00.600
the role. Either way, Sonic is speeding&nbsp;
towards release on December 20th, 2024.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:06.420
First introduced in the comics as a morally&nbsp;
ambiguous replacement for the Avengers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:11.940
the Thunderbolts team is composed of a variety&nbsp;
of former villains. The MCU movie Thunderbolts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.220
however, will introduce a slightly different team.

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:19.320
Announced in 2022, Thunderbolts will act as a&nbsp;
culmination of multiple storylines from previous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:24.600
films, featuring a cast made up of previously&nbsp;
seen anti-heroes. This includes Red Guardian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:30.000
Yelena Belova, Taskmaster, the Winter&nbsp;
Soldier, U.S. Agent, and the mysterious Ghost.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:31.560
"Still fits."

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:36.960
They'll be led by CIA director Valentina&nbsp;
Allegra de Fontaine, although it remains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:41.700
to be seen if Harrison Ford's Thaddeus Ross&nbsp;
will be a member of the team. We know Ford&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.125
will be showing up in Captain America: Brave New&nbsp;
World, just as we know Ross is a key member of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:44.125 --> 00:20:46.740
the Thunderbolts in the comics — but there's&nbsp;
been no confirmation that this character will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:51.840
appear in the film just yet. Meanwhile, Walking&nbsp;
Dead star Steven Yeun has joined the cast too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:56.880
with all signs suggesting that he will be playing&nbsp;
the super-powered goliath known as the Sentry.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:21:02.040
Directed by Jake Schreier and penned by Lee&nbsp;
Sung Jin, both of whom recently struck gold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:06.480
with the Netflix series Beef, the film&nbsp;
seems poised to rock the very foundations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:12.600
of the MCU. Expect to see these ragtag&nbsp;
heroes in action on December 20th, 2024.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:18.600
Once known only as a comedian, Jordan Peele&nbsp;
has recently established himself as one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:23.700
brightest writer-directors in Hollywood. Oozing&nbsp;
with atmosphere and filled with symbolism and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:29.520
allegory, his 2017 sci-fi thriller Get Out blew&nbsp;
the world away with its story of a young man who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:34.920
discovers a terrifying and bizarre secret after&nbsp;
meeting his girlfriend's family. Often exploring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:39.600
themes of racism and social injustice, Peele's&nbsp;
films have garnered an outpouring of critical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:45.000
acclaim, with follow-ups Us and Nope delivering&nbsp;
plenty of thrills and thought-provoking dramatics.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:49.620
In 2023, it was announced that Peele's&nbsp;
as-yet-untitled fourth film will arrive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:55.080
on Christmas Day, 2024, making it alternative&nbsp;
programming for big-budget blockbusters Sonic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.820
the Hedgehog 3 and Thunderbolts. As of press&nbsp;
time, we don't know the genre of the film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:04.200
let alone who will star or what it will be&nbsp;
about. Will it be a chilling horror movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:10.440
like Us or a mind-bending sci-fi like Get Out?&nbsp;
Nobody knows. But one thing is for sure: This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:15.240
movie will no doubt be a highly inventive project&nbsp;
starring some of the best actors in Hollywood;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:20.580
after all, Peele remains one of the most in-demand&nbsp;
filmmakers currently working. While we can't say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:25.020
who's involved just yet, you can make a&nbsp;
safe bet that Daniel Kaluuya will likely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:29.700
make an appearance, as the British actor has&nbsp;
starred in two of Peele's three films so far.

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:35.880
Actor-turned-director John Krasinski is still&nbsp;
wowing audiences in front of the camera with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:40.080
his leading role in the fourth and final&nbsp;
season of Jack Ryan. After that, though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:42.900
he'll be turning his attention&nbsp;
back to directing. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:42.900 --> 00:22:47.580
he recently announced his next film — and it's&nbsp;
not what you might expect from the creator of A&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:51.240
Quiet Place. Krasinski is mostly keeping&nbsp;
tight-lipped about the project for now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:55.620
but the name of the film is intriguing&nbsp;
enough on its own: It's titled simply IF.

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.100
IF is said to be a story about&nbsp;
childhood imagination. During&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.820
a presentation of behind-the-scenes&nbsp;
footage at CinemaCon, Krasinski said:

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:06.240
"I had this idea for a movie years&nbsp;
ago about imaginary friends."

00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:10.020
The film's cast will be a mix of&nbsp;
live-action stars and voice talent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:13.500
featuring Krasinski himself and a&nbsp;
number of Hollywood heavyweights,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:18.540
from Ryan Reynolds to Emily Blunt to Matt&nbsp;
Damon and more. Despite all that secrecy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:24.000
IF has already completed filming; the&nbsp;
movie is due for release on May 24th, 2024.

